  "worked_solution": "We want to determine if $B$ is indeed a basis of $\\text{Span}{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}.$ So, we want to find ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}\\in R$ such that \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{{[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{{a}_{1}}+{x}_{2}{{[\\begin{aligned}9 \\\\ 18\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{{a}_{2}}={{[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 12\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{{a}_{3}}.\n$$\n\nThis equation is equivalent to the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+9{x}_{2}=-6 \\\\ 6{x}_{1}+18{x}_{2}=12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we reduce the augmented matrix of the system to reduced row echelon form (RREF):\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,[\\begin{aligned}3 & 9 & -6 \\\\ 6 & 18 & 12\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 18 & 12\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-6){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 24\\end{aligned}] &  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the second row of the RREF matrix above, we see that the system of equations has no solution.\n\nTherefore, ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2}}$ is not a basis of $\\text{Span}{{a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}}.$",
